warning: grund.toml:7: [schema.sources.extensions] maps `md` to `json`, which does not read Markdown; `.md` is always Markdown, and until then a `.md` file is read as `json`; drop the entry, or map `md` to a `document` language; this becomes an error in grund 1.0.0
warning: grund.toml:13: [schema.kinds.RULE] folders entry `rules` can hold no file read as Markdown, because no admitted language reads Markdown; admit one in [schema.sources] languages, such as `markdown`; this becomes an error in grund 1.0.0
